# Fuzzing / analysis output — never commit anything a campaign PRODUCES
#
# The rules above this line were anchored to the repository root (`/fuzz-out/`,
# `/corpus/`), which meant a fuzz run inside demo/repositories/<target>/ wrote committable
# crash inputs and corpus entries. Those artifacts are derived from a target's content, and
# the day this repository goes public they become the thing that leaks it. Broadened to
# match at any depth.
#
# libFuzzer names its artifacts crash-<sha1>, leak-<sha1>, timeout-<sha1>, oom-<sha1> and
# slow-unit-<sha1> in the artifact_prefix directory, hence the prefix patterns.
fuzz-out/
**/fuzz-out/
**/fuzz-artifacts/
crashes/
**/crashes/
**/.cifuzz-corpus/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
slow-unit-*
*.sarif
*.profraw
*.profdata
*.sancov
/corpus/

# ...but the AUTHORED demo fixtures are tracked deliberately. The pktcfg seed corpus and
# its one crash input are product artifacts we wrote and reviewed, not campaign output, and
# the demo depends on them being in the repository. Re-included by exact path so the
# broadening above cannot swallow them, and asserted by
# tests/architecture/test_fuzz_artifacts_are_ignored.py.
# SEC-06-R: re-included by EXACT PATH, never by wildcard. `!.../corpus/**` re-admitted
# whatever a campaign wrote there, and libFuzzer's default artifact_prefix is the corpus
# directory — so the broadening above was undone by the exception beneath it. Note also
# that the authored crash fixture is named `crash-literal-tab.bin`, which the generic
# `crash-*` rule matches; only an exact path distinguishes it from a generated `crash-<sha1>`.
#
# Adding a fixture means adding a line here. That is the point: each one is a reviewed act.
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-bad-magic.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-empty.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-escaped-tab.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-escaped.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-hex.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-multi.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-simple.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/corpus/seed-truncated.bin
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/crash/
!demo/repositories/pktcfg/crash/crash-literal-tab.bin

# Claude local state
.claude/settings.local.json
.project/state.local.json

# Astro generated types cache
apps/command-center/.astro/
